  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Weighing module",
    "type_designations": ["W23", "C01", "C02", "C03"],
    "description": "The W23 and C Series comprises the weighing module (A/D board) of a BPS indicator and a main PCB connected to a range of load cells to form a family of Class III, I/O line powered or battery-operated, self-indicating, dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments. Alloy metal construction, stainless steel load receptor, integral LCD display, LCD/LED enunciators (STABLE, ZERO and NET), level indicator, adjustable feet. The W23 model has no operator keypad; the C models have a 4-key operator keypad (Light, Function, Zero and Tare). Interfaces: RS232, USB (optional). Intended to be used for direct sales to the public when connected to a Point of Sale device; may be connected to an Electronic Point of Sale (EPOS), Electronic Cash Register (ECR) or Electronic Fund Transfer (EFT/ECU). Software held in firmware with identification number V02.xx (version displayed at power-up); access to legally relevant parameters and download of software only possible via the calibration switch on the main board, prevented by sealing the enclosure. Access to electronics, load cell and calibration switch prevented by sealing the enclosure using a tamper-evident wire and seal solution. Gravity compensation."
